source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A word rune before the delimiter blocks the pair, so Jira renders the asterisks literally and jiro stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{x*y*z}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>x*y*z</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`x*y*z`
-- warnings.json --
[]
